after being looked at. Land them as named constants so they are one-line changes:

- **`TICKER_SPEED` against the strip's own rotation.** The band already turns, at
  18–67 seconds a revolution. Two motions compound where the arc faces the camera.
- **How much goes in the string.** All resolved channels is the honest default. If
  it reads as noise, filter to `polarity === 'health'` — one predicate in
  `tickerOf`.

### Definition of done

Ticker visible and readable on the live cluster; label cache flat; no ticker under
reduced motion.

