## Sequencing

```
Stage 0 ──────────────┐  (packages/api, independent)
Stage 1 ──────┐       │  (client, independent)
              ├─► 4 ──┤
Stage 2 ──► 3 ┘       │
                      └─► 5
```

0 and 1 can be done in either order or in parallel — different workspaces, no
shared files. 2 is half an hour. 3 is the largest and the most valuable on its own.
4 is the only stage that needs all of the others.

**Ship 0 and 3 first if anything has to be cut.** Stage 0 fixes a scene that
silently stops tracking the cluster; Stage 3 puts 91 measurements in front of a
human for the first time. Stage 4 is the one people will point at, and it is worth
the least of the three.

