## Risks

| Risk | Stage | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| A flapping target restarts its strip's spin | 0 | Confined to probe and overflow modules. Accept; server-side grace period if it proves noisy. |
| Reconcile now runs more often, walking every module through `normalize` | 0 | Only on set change, which is the intent. `useModules.ts:131-134` returns array identity when nothing actually changed. |
| Making bound controls controlled changes commit behaviour | 3 | It cannot: `useField` (`Fields.tsx:84-99`) guarantees a bound control registers no reader, so it has no commit path. Test 9 pins this. |
| `BINDINGS` referencing functions declared below it | 3 | Module-load TDZ error, caught immediately. Test 6 guards it. |
| Ticker rasterises a canvas per module per poll | 4 | Quantisation in `reading()`, pinned by ticker test 2. The Stage 1 sweep turns any residue from a leak into bounded churn. |
| Two strips sharing one ticker texture, scrolling double | 4 | Impossible by construction — keyed by id. Labels test 2. |
| Ticker illegible at 0.02 world units on the controller | 4 | `TICKER_MIN_SHARE` drops the window rather than showing mush. Visual check named above. |
| A grown bundle exceeds the 5 s query budget | 5 | Measure with the `time_total` command after each bundle change. |

